    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Wondrous Item, Uncommon (Requires Attunement)</em></p><p>This hat has 3 charges and regains all expended charges daily at dawn. While holding it, you can take a Magic action and expend 1 charge to release a magical vortex from it. The vortex fills a 10-foot Cube originating from you and lasts for 1 hour; while it is present, its area is Difficult Terrain.</p><p>You choose how the vortex looks when you create it—multicolored or glittering, for example.</p>",
